    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.15PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.09.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/13\u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 15 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dc3\u01ff\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.15\n\nNo. 2454/13 \u2013 MONDAY, SEPTEMBER 15, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nLAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nMy No.: 4-3/1/\u0d85\u0dad\u0dca.\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd.\u0db4\u0dad\u0dca/2021.\n\nHON. Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation has extended the service of the below named o\ufb03 cer appointed for the purpose of carrying out the land acquisitions for the Greater Colombo Flood Control and Environment Improvement Project, Weras Ganga Storm Water Drainage and Environment Improvement Project, Metro Colombo Urban Development Project and Kolonnawa Storm Drainage and Environment Project up to 02 years in terms of the provisions of the Land Acquisition Act.\n\nSchedule\n\nName of the O\ufb03 cer Authorized Area Extended Duration\n\n1. Mr. H. Thilakawardhana For Divisional Secretariat Divisions From 01.08.2025 (S. L. A. S., Class I - Retired) of Sri Jayawardenapura Kotte, to 31.07.2027 Colombo, Kaduwela, Kolonnawa, Dehiwala, Ratmalana, Maharagama, Kesbewa, Moratuwa, Thimbirigasyaya.\n\nD. P. W\u0d82\u0d7c\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d86\u0d7a\u0d8c\u0d82\u0d87\u0d80\u0d81\u0d7e, Secretary, Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Avenue, Battaramulla,10th September, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 \u2013 0143\n\n1A \u2013 G 045378 \u2013 09 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
