LE\n\nI. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Medadumbara.\n\nII. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in the Preliminary Plan No. \u0db8\u0dc4 5585 dated 12.12.2004 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Mangoda in the Minor Division of Udasiyapattuwa South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District of Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot No. 01 \u2013 Bogahamulahena \u2013 Extent: 0.2315 Hectare North: A portion of Lot No. 7 in P.P.A. 253; East: A portion of Lot No. 7 in P.P.A. 253 and Lot No. 6; South: A portion of Lot No. 7 in P.P.A. 253; West: Lot Nos. 8 and 10 in P.P.A. 253.\n\nEOG 09 \u2013 0136\n\n1A \u2013 G 045375 \u2013 19 (09/2025)"
