    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2454/33 - 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0db4\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd0\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.09.16\n\nNo. 2454/33 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 16, 2025 - 16.09.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice Under Section 7 My No.: DS/MN/LB/05/AQ/WPP/PhI.Ext/25. Land Ministry No.: 4-3/11/2022/CEB/152. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land or Servitude to be acquired:- The land allotments called Olaithoduvaikaani, in total extent of about 0.7349 Hectare depicted as Lot No. 1, 2 and 3 in plan No. Cadastral - 940060, Block No. 03, Sheet No. 04 and prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Olaithoduvai in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 60 of Olaithoduvai, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Mannar Town of Mannar District in Northern Province. Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Olaithoduvaikaani; Present use of the land: Low jungle; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Not Known; Extent: 0.6566 Hectare."
