    "chunk_text": "02. Lot No. 2 Name of the Land: Maligathenna Estate; Present use of the land: Home Garden, a mixed cultivation aged 20-30 years, a permanent building, and parts of 3 permanent buildings; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.4640 Hectare. (1 Acre 0 Roods 23.5 Perches)\n\n03. Lot No. 3 Name of the Land: Maligathenna Estate; Present use of the land: Open barren land; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.0804 Hectare. (0 Acre 0 Roods 31.8 Perches)\n\nOn the North by : Lot No. 2 and Lot No. 1215 of F.V.P. 621; On the East by : Lot Nos. 1215 and 1208 of F.V.P. 621; On the South by : Lot Nos. 1208 and 1209 of F.V.P. 621; On the West by : Lot No. 1209 of F.V.P. 621 and Lot Nos. 4 and 2 of this plan.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2014 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 045425 - 29 (09/2025)\n\n2 A III \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf \u0da2 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dba\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0d85 \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0dc3 \u0db4 \u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.09.22 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.09.2025\n\n04. Lot No. 4 Name of the Land: Maligathenna Estate; Present use of the land: Garden, a mixed cultivation aged about 20-30 years; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.0110 Hectare. (0 Acres 0 Roods 4.3 Perches)\n\nOn the North by : \u2014; On he East by : \u2014; On the South by : \u2014; On the West by : \u2014.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Deraniyagala on 17th November, 2025 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurther, it is hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) or before the 10th November, 2025 regarding the nature of their interests in the land/lands, particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount."
