    "chunk_text": "II. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of land depicted below in the Plan No. PP \u0dba\u0dcf 2936 dated 15.08.2019 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Maviddapuram in No.232 Maviddapuram South Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Valikamam North (Thellippalai) in Jaffna District of Northern Province and bounded as:\n\nEOG 09 - 0220\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.09.23\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 23.09.20252A\n\nCORRECTION PAPER THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) \u0d88\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d89\u0d8b\u0d88\u0d8f\u0d82\u0d8c\u0d88 (a) \u0d8d\u0d88 \u0d8c\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 Order No. 65 of 2022\n\nLand Ministry\u2019s Ref. No.: 4-3/9/2017/IR/448-H. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: \u0d85\u01e9/10/5/4/\u0db4\u0dc4\u0dc5 \u0db8\u0262\u0dc0\u01b1\u0d94\u0dba \u0da2\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0dba. IT is hereby declared that \u201cLot No.17\u201d which is appeared under Serial No. 18 on page 2A in the Schedule of the Order No.65 of 2022 under Proviso (a) to Section 38 of the Land Acquisition Act, published in the Sinhala language in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2268/9 dated 21.02.2022 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, shall be recti\ufb01 ed as \u201cLot No.18\u201d.\n\nOn page 3A, Western boundary of Lot No.33 given as \u201cState Low Jungle, Lot Nos.57 and 37\u201d shall be recti\ufb01 ed as \u201cState Low Jungle, Lot Nos.57 and 32\u201d, \u201cSouthern boundary of Lot No.35\u201d given as \u201cLot Nos.30 and 22\u201d shall be recti\ufb01 ed as \u201cLot Nos.36 and 22\u201d and on page 4A, \u201cNorthern boundary of Lot No.45\u201d given as \u201cLot No.42 and State Low Jungle\u201d shall be recti\ufb01 ed as \u201cLot No.44 and State Low Jungle\u201d. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/06, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,02nd September, 2025.\n\nEOG 09 - 0221\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
