 Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. S\u0d82\u0d80\u0d7e\u0d8b\u0d7a, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 17th September, 2025 EOG 09 - 0249/2 _________________________\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS"
