    "chunk_text": "1AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.05.30PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 30.05.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2456/13 \u2013 2025 \u0dc3\u0dd0\u0217\u0dad\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 30 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0d85\u0d9f\u0dc4\u025e\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.09.30\n\nNo. 2456/13 \u2013 TUESDAY, SEPTEMBER 30, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I: SECTION (I) \u2013 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Noti\ufb01cations\n\nPILGRIMAGES ORDINANCE\n\nIt is hereby notified that the Annual Duruthu Maha Religious Festival and Procession of Pilana Purana Sri Maha Temple in the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 152, Pilana, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Akmeemana, District of Galle, Southern Province, will be held from 04th of December 2025 to 3rd of January 2026 as per the regulations published in the Extra Ordinary Gazette Notification No. 2146/18 dated 22.10.2019 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka in terms of the Section 2 of the Pilgimages Ordinance (Cap.175).\n\nW.A. DHARMASIRI, District Secretary/Government Agent, Administrative District, Galle.\n\nDistrict Secretariat,Galle.25th October, 2025.\n\nEOG 09-0252\n\n1A \u2013 G 045456 \u2013 07 (09/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
