    "chunk_text": "06. Hence, Provincial Councils, Local Government Authorities, Rent Control Boards, State Corporations & Statutory Boards, Government Institutions, Banks, Private Institutions and the Public are hereby notified to forward their written requests for consideration of refunds mentioned in Paragraph 02 above along with the relevant Money Orders to the under mentioned address by Registered Post to reach the Controller (Money Order Services) within three months from the date of publishing this Gazette Notification.\n\nController, Money Order Services Money Order Service Section Deputy Post Master General (Central Province) Office Postal Complex Department of Posts Kandy\n\n08. No refund shall be made for the claims made for any Money Orders issued prior to 01.01.2022 under any circumstances.\n\nDr. Nalinda Jayatissa (M. P.) Minister of Health & Mass Media.\n\nColombo,On this 25 day of September, 2025.\n\nEOG 10 - 0001\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
